#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:1
msgid "PwC x Zhangjiang Healthcare Accelerator"
msgstr "普华永道张江数字医疗加速营"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:4
msgid "普华永道张江数字医疗加速营"
msgstr "普华永道张江数字医疗加速营"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:6
msgid "Accelerator | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "加速器｜浦东新区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Health, Software AI."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：健康、AI软件。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:10
msgid ""
"PwC describes a digital healthcare acceleration initiative supported by "
"Pudong and Zhangjiang. The evidence establishes the initiative; a "
"currently accepting cohort and its commercial terms require confirmation."
msgstr "普华永道公开介绍过由浦东及张江支持的数字医疗加速项目。资料可确认项目曾开展，当前是否征集项目及具体商业条款仍需咨询。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S012 "
"<https://www.pwccn.com/en/services/entrepreneurial-and-private-business/startup-accelerator.html>`_. "
"PwC China: Scaleup Accelerator."
msgstr "`资料来源 S012 <https://www.pwccn.com/en/services/entrepreneurial-and-private-business/startup-accelerator.html>`_. PwC China: Scaleup Accelerator."

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:24
msgid ""
"`Official website / intake route "
"<https://www.pwccn.com/en/services/entrepreneurial-and-private-business/startup-accelerator.html>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://www.pwccn.com/en/services/entrepreneurial-and-private-business/startup-accelerator.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:26
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:28
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:30
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:33
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:35
msgid "Identify the corporate business owner and one measurable use case."
msgstr "找到企业业务负责人，明确可量化的应用需求。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit the product brief, pilot evidence and relevant technical "
"requirements."
msgstr "提交产品简介、试点结果及相关技术要求。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:39
msgid ""
"Confirm cohort availability or agree a scoped pilot, data rights and IP "
"terms."
msgstr "确认项目是否正在征集，或另行约定试点范围、数据权属和知识产权。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:41
msgid ""
"Review procurement, payment, acceptance and the production decision "
"separately."
msgstr "分别确认采购、付款、验收流程，以及转为正式部署的决策条件。"

#: ../../entities/pwc.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`Pudong district route </districts/pudong>`"
msgstr ":doc:`浦东新区合作指南 </districts/pudong>`"

